  "review": "\n<div class=\"space-y-10\">\n  <!-- 特集ヘッダーヒーロー -->\n  <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-rose-950/40 to-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-2xl space-y-6\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n      <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-rose-600/90 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-lg\">\n        <span>🏆</span> 2026年最新FANZA公式アーカイブ厳選ランキング\n      </div>\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-white leading-tight\">\n        【極上W癒しの美乳サンドウィッチ】FANZA「憧れの巨乳美女2人に挟まれて骨抜きにされるWパイズリ＆至福のハーレム愛撫」おすすめ人気神作ランキングTOP5！右も左もデカパイ天国・至高の肉弾サンドウィッチ【2026年最新決定版】\n      </h1>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1\">\n        <a href=\"/genre/kyonyuu\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">巨乳</a> <a href=\"/genre/%E3%83%8F%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%A0%E3%83%BB%E9%80%863P\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">ハーレム・逆3P</a> <a href=\"/genre/paizuri\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">パイズリ</a> <a href=\"/genre/binyuu\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">美乳</a> <a href=\"/genre/tantai-sakuhin\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">単体作品</a> <a href=\"/genre/dokusen-haishin\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-amber-300 bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700/80 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium border border-slate-700 transition\">独占配信</a> <a href=